// The boss's cleave: 89 ticks, the default cleave (docs/architecture.md
// section 11, "模型和动画"): startup 0-45, active 45-49, recovery 49-89.
// Each part has keyframes at its ends, so the game can stretch each part
// on its own. Rotations are YXZ degrees about each bone's position along
// the model's axes (+X right, +Y up, -Z forward); see assets/anims/README.md.
//
// 0: standing. 20: lifting the halberd in both hands. 45: raised high
// behind the head, leaning back. 46 to 49: one key a tick, the chop over
// the top and down in front, the left foot stepping in and the body
// bending into it; at 49 the tip is near the ground ahead (the hit is a
// narrow sector 4 m long). 60: still down. 72: pulling it up. 89: standing.
